{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Basemat daughter of Ishmael.</b> Yet further on she is called Mahalat? We find in the aggadah of Midrash Samuel: three have their sins forgiven them — a convert who converts, one who rises to greatness, and one who marries a wife. And the reason is learned from here — therefore she is called Mahalat, for his sins were forgiven." "<b>Sister of Nebaioth.</b> Because he gave her to him in marriage, she is called by his name — for from the time Ishmael died he was called by his name."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:14.710131312Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}